{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your face is the controller!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you reach the goal first, or will your facial muscles give up first?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jaw Jump!</i> is a 2D action game controlled through facial expressions using your webcam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your mouth to jump, tilt your head to control the direction, and keep climbing higher and higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a simple yet precise platforming challenge that will make you want to try again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Webcam play is recommended, but mouse control is also supported.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045060?t=1760544202","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045060?t=1760544202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045060/5166a811d8b330f81cf43628f8fea0b02fecc1c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760544202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045060/5166a811d8b330f81cf43628f8fea0b02fecc1c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760544202","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your face is the controller!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you reach the goal first, or will your facial muscles give up first?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jaw Jump!</i> is a 2D action game con